  "notable_quotes": [
    "HAF-1 shows very high C3H6/C3H8 selectivity up to 1.67 × 10^7 at 298 K and higher C3H6 capacity than previously reported molecular sieving adsorbents.",
    "Breakthrough tests show HAF-1 delivers polymer-grade propylene at ≥99.7% purity with a productivity of 33.9 l kg−1 in a single adsorption–desorption cycle.",
    "Conventional narrow-channel molecular sieving improves exclusion of larger molecules but partially sacrifices diffusion and adsorption capacity of the smaller target molecule."
